ACTIVITY 2: DUCK TYPING

1a. What is duck typing?
Duck typing allows an object to be used as long as it has the required method, regardless of its class or inheritance.

1b. What did the Car class need?
The Car class needed to have the same method called in the loop so it could work with Dog and Cat without inheritingfrom the Animal class.

